WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.625 --> 00:00:13.453
"Wow," Roxy thought.

2
00:00:13.473 --> 00:00:17.036
"I wonder if Robin is Thunderhawk."

3
00:00:18.897 --> 00:00:20.279
She looked over at Detective Smith.

4
00:00:20.299 --> 00:00:25.723
"Detective," Roxy said, "I think—" The detective's phone rang.

5
00:00:25.743 --> 00:00:30.507
"Hello? Oh no!

6
00:00:30.767 --> 00:00:31.608
We'll be right there!"

7
00:00:32.564 --> 00:00:33.925
Detective Smith looked at Roxy.

8
00:00:34.766 --> 00:00:36.967
"Thunderhawk is at Metro City Zoo.

9
00:00:37.447 --> 00:00:38.368
What were you going to tell me?"

10
00:00:38.388 --> 00:00:42.011
"Never mind," Roxy said.

11
00:00:43.071 --> 00:00:44.852
Zoom! Roxy flew off.

12
00:00:48.115 --> 00:00:51.017
When Roxy arrived at the zoo, people were running in every direction.

13
00:00:51.037 --> 00:00:54.859
"There's a big hawk person!"

14
00:00:54.879 --> 00:00:57.581
"Run for your lives!"

15
00:01:00.503 --> 00:01:01.804
Roxy spotted Thunderhawk.

16
00:01:02.156 --> 00:01:04.237
The villain was perched on top of the bird building.

17
00:01:05.617 --> 00:01:07.438
She had large wings and a hawk mask.

18
00:01:08.879 --> 00:01:11.320
"That's definitely Robin," Roxy thought.

19
00:01:12.400 --> 00:01:14.141
"Thunderhawk!" she shouted.

20
00:01:15.442 --> 00:01:16.282
Robin looked over.

21
00:01:16.302 --> 00:01:19.443
"Go away, Rocket Girl!

22
00:01:19.903 --> 00:01:21.444
I'm freeing these birds!"

23
00:01:22.304 --> 00:01:24.245
The villain smashed a hole in the building's roof.

24
00:01:25.466 --> 00:01:26.246
Birds flew out.

25
00:01:26.266 --> 00:01:29.727
"You can't do that!"

26
00:01:29.988 --> 00:01:30.728
Roxy shouted.

27
00:01:32.240 --> 00:01:34.281
"Birds shouldn't be in cages!"

28
00:01:34.661 --> 00:01:35.321
Robin cried.

29
00:01:35.341 --> 00:01:37.381
"They should be free!"

30
00:01:37.401 --> 00:01:42.143
"You won't be free for much longer, Thunderhawk," Roxy said.

31
00:01:42.163 --> 00:01:44.283
"You're going to jail!"

32
00:01:45.224 --> 00:01:46.444
Roxy shot toward Robin.

33
00:01:47.444 --> 00:01:50.125
She reached out to grab the villain.

34
00:01:50.165 --> 00:01:50.885
Robin leaped.

35
00:01:52.165 --> 00:01:52.926
Roxy missed her.

36
00:01:54.026 --> 00:01:55.546
"Hurricane wind!"

37
00:01:55.966 --> 00:01:56.667
Robin shouted.

38
00:01:57.687 --> 00:01:59.187
She flapped her huge wings.

39
00:02:02.016 --> 00:02:03.217
Whoo-whoo-whoosh! A strong wind blew.

40
00:02:04.018 --> 00:02:05.599
Roxy tried to stay where she was.

41
00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:07.941
But the wind was too strong.

42
00:02:08.902 --> 00:02:12.205
Roxy tumbled backward, crashing through the fence of a gorilla exhibit.

43
00:02:13.846 --> 00:02:16.689
"Oof!" Roxy sat up and looked around.

44
00:02:18.911 --> 00:02:19.932
A gorilla looked at her.

45
00:02:21.833 --> 00:02:23.695
Then it jumped out of the exhibit and ran off.

46
00:02:25.356 --> 00:02:26.557
"Uh-oh!" Roxy said.

47
00:02:27.098 --> 00:02:29.140
She already heard people shouting and screaming.

48
00:02:29.772 --> 00:02:31.073
"A gorilla's loose!"

49
00:02:31.854 --> 00:02:33.355
"Run for your lives!"

50
00:02:36.398 --> 00:02:37.819
Roxy crawled out of the exhibit.

51
00:02:39.180 --> 00:02:41.482
Robin swooped over the crowd of screaming people.

52
00:02:41.502 --> 00:02:45.605
"I have to stop Robin," Roxy thought.

53
00:02:45.625 --> 00:02:48.147
"But that gorilla is on the loose!"

54
00:02:49.428 --> 00:02:50.749
Roxy flew after the gorilla.

55
00:02:51.550 --> 00:02:53.532
She saw a zookeeper approaching the animal.

56
00:02:55.113 --> 00:02:56.794
The zookeeper glanced up at Roxy.

57
00:02:56.814 --> 00:02:58.596
"Don't worry, Rocket Girl!

58
00:02:58.920 --> 00:03:01.042
I'll take Melvin back to the gorilla exhibit.

59
00:03:01.302 --> 00:03:03.024
Just stop that villain, please!"

60
00:03:05.606 --> 00:03:06.727
Roxy flew over the zoo.

61
00:03:06.747 --> 00:03:09.068
"Where did Robin go?"

62
00:03:09.389 --> 00:03:09.849
she thought.

63
00:03:11.090 --> 00:03:12.311
Then she saw a stampede.

64
00:03:13.132 --> 00:03:16.755
Elephants, rhinos, and other animals were chasing people all over the place!

65
00:03:19.877 --> 00:03:20.878
Roxy heard laughter.

66
00:03:22.319 --> 00:03:23.560
Robin was flying away.

67
00:03:23.580 --> 00:03:27.884
"Good luck catching all those animals, Rocket Girl!"
